      "text": "We ordered back all of our remaining forces to Coromodir except for a few units defending Panzyr and Tyrlon and we have evacuated as many people as we can to safer locations but that safety might be only temporary.\n\nWe have detected several Harbinger DropShips heading for landing zones, it is time now to deploy our forces to stop them.",
