      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c0fd5b1a8c9397b94932fff"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Coromodir is the most populous and rich system of the Aurigan Reach, which makes it such a target for those Periphery marauders.\n\nThis also makes it challenging to defend because of the multitude of targets, although the presence of the <i>Argo</i> gives us a small tactical advantage to quickly redeploy the company. ",
      "branches": [
