      "text": "We have also been placed into Interdiction by ComStar following the destruction of Coromodir's HPG transmitter shortly after the completion of the coup that deposed House Espinosa.\n\nAt the time we thought it was the work of Directorate saboteurs, now it is far more likely that the Harbingers were behind it.",
